 "nl": [
  "database must accept HTTP (TCP 80) and MySQL (TCP 3306) and SMB (TCP 445) from vpn-users.",
  "Block TFTP (UDP 69), SNMP (UDP 161) from dev-lab to admin; the rest of any UDP port between them is allowed.",
  "Make HTTP (TCP 80) on partners reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Allow hr to connect to backup using HTTP (TCP 80) and SMB (TCP 445) and MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "Hosts in database may reach backup over DNS over UDP 53 and RTSP (TCP 554).",
  "Deny all traffic from vpn-users to backup (this overrides any public service).",
  "Make DNS over UDP 53 on library reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Allow research to connect to backup using RTSP (TCP 554) and PostgreSQL (TCP 5432).",
  "No packet from library may enter database, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Make HTTPS (TCP 443) on backup reachable from all internal zones.",
  "backup must never reach research, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Block TFTP (UDP 69), SNMP (UDP 161) from admin to backup; the rest of any UDP port between them is allowed.",
  "Hosts in hr may reach admin over syslog (UDP 514).",
  "Apart from hr on HTTPS (TCP 443); admin on NTP (UDP 123), all traffic originating in partners must be dropped.",
  "Deny all traffic from admin to vpn-users (this overrides any public service).",
  "library must accept HTTP (TCP 80) and RDP (TCP 3389) and PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) from dev-lab.",
  "database must accept MySQL (TCP 3306) and RTSP (TCP 554) and HTTPS (TCP 443) from vpn-users.",
  "Any zone may connect to nvr over HTTP (TCP 80) and NTP (UDP 123).",
  "Block Telnet (TCP 23), FTP (TCP 21) from research to admin; the rest of any TCP port between them is allowed.",
  "database must accept SMB (TCP 445) and HTTPS (TCP 443) and syslog (UDP 514) from hr.",
  "Hosts in research may reach partners over IMAP (TCP 143) and HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "vpn-users must accept MySQL (TCP 3306) from nvr.",
  "No packet from library may enter dev-lab, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Apart from dev-lab on HTTPS (TCP 443), all traffic originating in library must be dropped.",
  "Restrict admin so that its only permitted destinations are database on HTTPS (TCP 443); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "backup offers HTTP (TCP 80) and DNS over UDP 53 to every zone.",
  "hr offers HTTPS (TCP 443) and DNS over UDP 53 to every zone.",
  "admin offers HTTP (TCP 80) and DNS over UDP 53 to every zone.",
  "Allow research to connect to admin using syslog (UDP 514).",
  "Make HTTPS (TCP 443) on library reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Allow library to connect to nvr using RTSP (TCP 554) and IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Make HTTP (TCP 80) on vpn-users reachable from all internal zones."
 ],
